ão Cloud na Administração Pública - 2025 e a sua relevância para o próximo ciclo de transformação digital do Estado, fazendo a ponte para o Plano Nacional da Nuvem Soberana (PNNS).\&q;,\&q;image\&q;:[{\&q;id\&q;:\&q;a3591a07-aba8-48f6-9b5f-0c8785fbfc6b\&q;,\&q;mimeType\&q;:\&q;image/jpeg\&q;,\&q;url\&q;:\&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/a3591a07-aba8-48f6-9b5f-0c8785fbfc6b/\&q;,\&q;thumbnailUrl\&q;:\&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/a3591a07-aba8-48f6-9b5f-0c8785fbfc6b?width=100&a;mode=Max\&q;,\&q;fileName\&q;:\&q;relatorio-impacto-da-governacao-cloud-na-ap-2025.jpg\&q;,\&q;fileHash\&q;:\&q;0Nq95neQdM6OYIX7ji9tP+XzvgDyoXaPLK7zgxHzdpI=\&q;,\&q;fileType\&q;:\&q;jpg\&q;,\&q;metadata\&q;:{\&q;pixelWidth\&q;:1366,\&q;pixelHeight\&q;:860,\&q;imageQuality\&q;:79,\&q;description\&q;:\&q;JFIF File\&q;}}],\&q;imageMobile\&q;:[{\&q;id\&q;:\&q;a3591a07-aba8-48f6-9b5f-0c8785fbfc6b\&q;,\&q;mimeType\&q;:\&q;image/jpeg\&q;,\&q;url\&q;:\&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/a3591a07-aba8-48f6-9b5f-0c8785fbfc6b/\&q;,\&q;thumbnailUrl\&q;:\&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/a3591a07-aba8-48f6-9b5f-0c8785fbfc6b?width=100&a;mode=Max\&q;,\&q;fileName\&q;:\&q;relatorio-impacto-da-governacao-cloud-na-ap-2025.jpg\&q;,\&q;fileHash\&q;:\&q;0Nq95neQdM6OYIX7ji9tP+XzvgDyoXaPLK7zgxHzdpI=\&q;,\&q;fileType\&q;:\&q;jpg\&q;,\&q;metadata\&q;:{\&q;pixelWidth\&q;:1366,\&q;pixelHeight\&q;:860,\&q;imageQuality\&q;:79,\&q;description\&q;:\&q;JFIF File\&q;}}],\&q;additionalContents\&q;:null,\&q;documents\&q;:null,\&q;seo\&q;:null,\&q;features\&q;:null,\&q;lastModified\&q;:\&q;2026-08-17T11:07:37.000Z\&q;,\&q;signLanguageInfoMessage\&q;:null,\&q;languageInfoMessage\&q;:null,\&q;generalInfo\&q;:null,\&q;documentationInfo\&q;:null},{\&q;title\&q;:\&q;C-Days: Conferência Anual do Centro Nacional de Cibersegurança\&q;,\&q;readingTime\&q;:2,\&q;author\&q;:\&q;Centro Nacional de Cibersegurança (CNCS)\&q;,\&q;date\&q;:\&q;2026-06-16T11:00:00.000Z\&q;,\&q;endDate\&q;:\&q;2026-06-18T17:00:00.000Z\&q;,\&q;days\&q;:null,\&q;scheduleTitle\&q;:null,\&q;timelineTitle\&q;:null,\&q;showScheduleTags\&q;:null,\&q;speakers\&q;:[],\&q;eventVideoLink\&q;:null,\&q;pageSize\&q;:15,\&q;location\&q;:\&q;Online\&q;,\&q;category\&q;:{\&q;id\&q;:\&q;a8518c22-2c88-4afa-97bd-632206fa5e47\&q;,\&q;name\&q;:\&q;formacoes-e-workshops\&q;,\&q;title\&q;:\&q;Formações e Workshops\&q;},\&q;tags\&q;:[],\&q;body\&q;:\&q;\&q;,\&q;slug\&q;:\&q;pt/agenda/c-days-conferencia-anual-do-centro-nacional-de-cibersegurança\&q;,\&q;created\&q;:\&q;2026-06-16T11:18:54.000Z\&q;,\&q;teaser\&q;:\&q;A conferência anual do Centro Nacional de Cibersegurança decorre entre 16 e 18 de junho, no Centro de Congressos da Alfândega do Porto. O evento gratuito, mediante inscrição prévia, decorre em formato presencial. A edição deste ano inclui uma sessão dedicada à cloud soberana e à Estratégia Digital Nacional.\&q;,\&q;image\&q;:[{\&q;id\&q;:\&q;e6488e39-5159-4934-92a3-a46fdc7f68c4\&q;,\&q;mimeType\&q;:\&q;image/jpeg\&q;,\&q;url\&q;:\&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/e6488e39-5159-4934-92a3-a46fdc7f68c4/\&q;,\&q;thumbnailUrl\&q;:\&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/e6488e39-5159-4934-92a3-a46fdc7f68c4?width=100&a;mode=Max\&q;,\&q;fileName\&q;:\&q;C-Days.jpg\&q;,\&q;fileHash\&q;:\&q;pvgSOrEvczJWbYZg4ltYS9jWIDMh5yDXjjMpij9JZH8=\&q;,\&q;fileType\&q;:\&q;jpg\&q;,\&q;metadata\&q;:{\&q;pixelWidth\&q;:1366,\&q;pixelHeight\&q;:860,\&q;imageQuality\&q;:79,\&q;description\&q;:\&q;JFIF File\&q;}}],\&q;imageMobile\&q;:[{\&q;id\&q;:\&q;e6488e39-5159-4934-92a3-a46fdc7f68c4\&q;,\&q;mimeType\&q;:\&q;image/jpeg\&q;,\&q;url\&q;:\&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/e6488e39-5159-4934-92a3-a46fdc7f68c4/\&q;,\&q;thumbnailUrl\&q;:\&q;https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/e6488e39-5159-4934-92a3-a46fdc7f68c4?width=100&a;mode=Max\&q;,\&q;fileName\&q;:\&q;C-Days.jpg\&q;,\&q;fileHash\&q;:\&q;pvgSOrEvczJWbYZg4ltYS9jWIDMh5yDXjjMpij9JZH8=\&q;,\&q;fileType\&q;:\&q;jpg\&q;,\&q;metadata\&q;:{\&